WEBVTT

00:00:03.073 --> 00:00:03.753
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:10.203
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hi. Where are you from?

00:00:10.563 --> 00:00:13.240
<v><b>B:</b></v> We’re from Recife, in Brazil.

00:00:13.726 --> 00:00:18.005
<v><b>A:</b></v> OK. Good luck to the Brazilian team!

00:00:18.446 --> 00:00:19.406
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thank you!

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:24.257
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:27.711 --> 00:00:31.786
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hello. I’m Mike from USA News.

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:34.064
Where are you from?

00:00:34.431 --> 00:00:36.091
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m from Australia.

00:00:36.877 --> 00:00:38.530
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you from Sydney?

00:00:38.967 --> 00:00:42.911
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I’m not. I’m from Cairns.

00:00:43.515 --> 00:00:46.997
<v><b>A:</b></v> Where’s Cairns? Is it near Sydney?

00:00:47.451 --> 00:00:49.162
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, it isn’t.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.030
It’s in the North.

00:00:52.117 --> 00:00:53.597
Am I on TV?

00:00:53.978 --> 00:00:55.771
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes, you are.

00:00:56.251 --> 00:00:57.244
<v><b>B:</b></v> Wow!

00:01:01.745 --> 00:01:02.400
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:01:06.172 --> 00:01:08.645
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hi. Are you American?

00:01:09.094 --> 00:01:12.295
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, we aren’t. We’re from Japan.

00:01:12.877 --> 00:01:14.438
<v><b>A:</b></v> Oh, sorry!